          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "We gain strength from product diversity."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          301.47058823529414,
          343.4769823232324,
          258.8627450980392,
          13.666666666666629
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Futura-CondensedBold",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "We keep a close watch on the bottom line."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          331.61764705882354,
          154.35671717171726,
          602.9595829248366,
          11.777107638888879
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Garamond-BookCondensed",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "At any given time, changing customer needs, market conditions and economic factors can impact the"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          301.47058823529414,
          177.00507575757592,
          633.3394942810459,
          11.777107638888879
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Garamond-BookCondensed",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "revenues we derive from one of our product lines, either positively or negatively. But that is precisely the"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          301.47058823529414,
          199.65343434343447,
          633.3729240196078,
          11.777107638888879
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Garamond-BookCondensed",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "advantage that product diversity gives us. We supply a range of different products, many of which hold leading"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          301.47058823529414,
          222.30179292929301,
          633.128414624183,
          11.777107638888879
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Garamond-BookCondensed",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "market positions, to a range of different market niches. This helps us to achieve growth without a"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          301.47058823529414,
          244.95015151515167,
          633.1451797385621,
          11.777107638888879
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Garamond-BookCondensed",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "disproportionate dependence on a single product or market and provides stability and consistency for our"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          301.47058823529414,
          267.5985101010102,
          79.4023284313725,
          11.777107638888879
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Garamond-BookCondensed",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "revenue base."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          331.61764705882354,
          290.24686868686877,
          602.961308006536,
          11.777107638888879
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Garamond-BookCondensed",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "In 2003, we achieved revenue growth in the majority of our product lines, contributing to the generation"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          301.47058823529414,
          312.8952272727274,
          282.1597222222223,
          11.777107638888879
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Garamond-BookCondensed",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "of continuing strong cash flows for the company."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          331.61764705882354,
          376.82829513888896,
          603.1589052287582,
          11.777159406565602
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Garamond-BookCondensed",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "A company with manufacturing at its core faces the continuing challenge to make its products faster,"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          301.47058823529414,
          399.4766537247475,
          633.2557859477125,
          11.777159406565715
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Garamond-BookCondensed",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "better and more economically. We view this challenge as a continuing opportunity to increase profitability and"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          301.47058823529414,
          422.12501231060605,
          202.5882185457516,
          11.777159406565715
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Garamond-BookCondensed",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "improve our operational efficiency."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          331.61764705882354,
          444.7733708964647,
          602.9679571078432,
          11.777159406565602
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Garamond-BookCondensed",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Over the past several years, we have made significant investments in the upgrading of our automated"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          301.47058823529414,
          467.42172948232326,
          633.3561589052289,
          11.777159406565715
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Garamond-BookCondensed",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "manufacturing equipment, enabling us to produce higher volumes in less time and with greater cost efficiency."
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          301.47058823529414,
          490.0700880681818,
          633.2892156862745,
          11.777159406565715
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Garamond-BookCondensed",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "We also have taken steps toward the consolidation of common systems and processes among our three"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          301.47058823529414,
          512.7184466540405,
          144.234265114379,
          11.777159406565602
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Garamond-BookCondensed",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "manufacturing locations."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          331.61764705882354,
          535.366805239899,
          603.0919620098039,
          11.777159406565659
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Garamond-BookCondensed",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "In 2003, we continued to make solid headway in our never-ending quest for operational improvement,"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          301.47058823529414,
          558.0151638257576,
          633.2724505718954,
          11.777159406565659
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Garamond-BookCondensed",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "which is a primary focus of our business strategy. Our ability to hold the line on operational costs, coupled"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          301.47058823529414,
          580.6635224116162,
          633.1267732843137,
          11.777159406565602
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Garamond-BookCondensed",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "with increased revenues from product sales, contributed to a 20 percent improvement in operating income"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          301.47058823529414,
          603.3118809974748,
          63.26569648692811,
          11.777159406565659
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Garamond-BookCondensed",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "over 2002."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          331.61764705882354,
          625.9602395833333,
          602.9679571078432,
          11.777159406565659
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Garamond-BookCondensed",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Our strategy for the future continues to be focused on growth, as we remain committed to the"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          301.47058823529414,
          648.608598169192,
          633.1050004084967,
          11.777159406565659
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Garamond-BookCondensed",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "fundamentals that have served us well: Financial strength that fuels continuing growth. Products that meet the"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          301.47058823529414,
          671.2569567550505,
          460.99227614379083,
          11.777159406565659
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Garamond-BookCondensed",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "needs of select markets. Productivity and profitability that improve year by year."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          331.61764705882354,
          693.905315340909,
          603.0082369281046,
          11.777159406565659
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Garamond-BookCondensed",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "To that end, we will continue to put products into the marketplace that represent the highest standards of"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          301.47058823529414,
          716.5536739267677,
          633.2054906045752,
          11.777159406565659
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Garamond-BookCondensed",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "integrity and innovation. We will be relentless in our pursuit of operational measures that improve productivity"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          301.47058823529414,
          739.2020325126263,
          633.2556854575163,
          11.777159406565659
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Garamond-BookCondensed",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "and produce bottom-line benefits. We will seek out new ways to expand market opportunities and increase"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          301.47058823529414,
          761.8503910984848,
          633.3729240196078,
          11.777159406565659
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Garamond-BookCondensed",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "sales. We will continue to deploy our financial resources in the wisest way we can. We pledge our best effort"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          301.47058823529414,
          784.4987496843435,
          633.1317810457516,
          11.777159406565659
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Garamond-BookCondensed",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "to achieving a double-digit rate of growth in earnings per share from continuing operations. And we will"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          301.47058823529414,
          807.147108270202,
          513.4881535947712,
          11.777159406565659
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Garamond-BookCondensed",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "remain vigilant in our determination to return value to those who invest in our company."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          331.61764705882354,
